  "fixes": [
    "Make the ICC stdexec integration tests unconditional with pneumo mandatory execution support.",
    "Separate the initial 5 s handshake allowance from the unchanged 500 ms active heartbeat timeout; cold M4 Debug hello was measured about 730 ms after UI startup.",
    "Exercise deferred provider shutdown, late replies and explicit replacement through composed senders on the serialized bridge.",
    "Restore full clang-tidy parsing using real generated assets, exclude test-target recompilations, and explicitly initialize the private optional control-call aggregate.",
    "Rebase raw STEP startup timestamps after initial buffer calculation; preserve the hardware arm deadline check. A failing rollover model now passes.",
    "Update the electrical fixture for required neutral homing and enough initial switch clearance for cancellation; explicitly select its previously qualified M4 SDRAM code placement.",
    "Separate sanitizer host watchdog budgets from simulated controller deadlines and normal-build UI latency qualification."
  ],
